{"unit_id":"ZiYuan258__dsh-skill-router#card-card-zh","repo":"ZiYuan258/dsh-skill-router","commit":"df07959830f62e644c97c18c9b23a4746b3a63c9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-router 是面向 DSH Web 的技能库检索与按需加载插件。它注册 skill_search、skill_load 和 skill_ref 工具，并在会话界面提供技能页签，展示会话实际查找与加载的技能。用户可从工作区外置技能索引中按关键词搜索、按名称载入技能正文，并继续读取该技能附带的参考文件；插件还带有入门技能库。适合技能库规模较大、希望只按需把少数技能放入上下文的 DSH 用户。需要 DSH、Node.js 20.18 或更高版本和可访问的技能文件库；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:1392-1414","host.js:1948-1967","host.js:2035-2048","client.js:106-117"]}
{"unit_id":"ZiYuan258__dsh-skill-router#card-card-en","repo":"ZiYuan258/dsh-skill-router","commit":"df07959830f62e644c97c18c9b23a4746b3a63c9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-router lets DSH users search an indexed skill library, load selected instructions, and read related files on demand. It registers three tools and adds a session tab showing skills found and loaded. Requires DSH, Node.js 20.18+, and accessible skill files; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:1392-1414","host.js:1948-1967","host.js:2035-2048","client.js:106-117"]}
