{"unit_id":"ZiYuan258__dsh-skill-router#feature-feature-1","repo":"ZiYuan258/dsh-skill-router","commit":"df07959830f62e644c97c18c9b23a4746b3a63c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-router 的功能「技能关键词搜索」：提供 skill_search，按查询词检索索引并返回匹配技能、描述和来源仓库；可限制结果数量、筛选仓库、只看名称或查看匹配解释。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:1392-1414"]}
